    "engagement": 0,
    "summary": "GOOK is what happens when the community finds a machine with no off switch and feeds it a memecoin.\n\nSomeone glued a coin to a hook —> GOOK was born. It runs on GlueHook, the free, keyless Uniswap V4 hook: the pool buys back GOOK inside every buy, absorbs sells before they hit the price, burns its cut forever, and compounds its own liquidity while you sleep. No team wallet pressing buttons. No admin keys. Liquidity Locked.\n\nEvery trade feeds the machine:\n\nETH fees → 50% compound back into the LP, 50% fuel the buyback pot. Humans get 0%.\nGOOK fees → 50% compound back into the LP, 50% burned. Humans get 0%.\nThe pot pumps on buys and eats sells. Buy GOOK and the pot buys alongside you, inside your own transaction. Sell GOOK and the pot absorbs it at the pool's own price before it ever touches the chart.\n\nBuyback output → 51% burned forever, 49% recycled into the pool's own liquidity. The recipient is set to 🔥 BURN — nobody collects. Ever.\nSo the flywheel is: volume → fees → half compounds the LP deeper, half buys GOOK back → what gets bought back gets burned or becomes more LP → deeper LP earns more fees → repeat. Supply only goes down, liquidity only goes up, and there is no key on earth that can stop it.",
